ogans say quads because they have four  testicles  given their nature krogan developed a  society that values strength and is  composed of individual clans each of  which is overseen  by an overlord there's also a spiritual  element to croak in society as well  with each clan possessing a shaman to  provide spiritual guidance and krogan  growing up by performing specific rites  of passage  like the other species we've talked  about in these lore videos the krogan  became the dominant species of their  world conquering tuchanka and eventually  like most sentient milky way species  evolving to the point of achieving  industrialization this briefly led to a  period of architectural  and artistic advancement but it was  short-lived  as the krogan had evolved to be an  aggressive species in order to survive  on tichonka  they possessed an innate bloodlust for  seeking out challenges  but with industrialization no other  species on tachanka could provide  that so they decided to fight each other  instead  by 1900 bce over 4 000 years prior to  the events of mass effect 1  the krogan had developed nuclear weapons  and individual clans entered all-out  nuclear war  the conflict pretty much destroys  tichonka plunging the planet into a  nuclear winter  for 2 000 years the remaining krogan  clans struggled to survive  continuing to fight one another over the  planet's now scarce amount of resources  and that's the state the solarians found  them in in adce  okay let's pivot really quick remember  our last mass effect lore video the one  about the first contact war  that conflict can be traced back to the  citadel activating dormant mass relays  and accidentally discovering the raknai  which led to the rachni wars and one ce  the lore of the krogan ties back to that  story too in one  ce the citadel council is solely  composed of the asari and salarians the  former provides wisdom while the latter  contributes leadership and scientific  research  so while both have armies neit