cally put the krogan in  the same  spot they were in prior to nuclear war  devastating tachanka  the krogan are rapidly expanding and  have no challenge to curb their growth  only now they have the technology to  expand to more  worlds and find other species to fight  instead of fighting each other  over the next 400 years the krogan  spread across the milky way forcibly  claiming already inhabited worlds  noting the public's growing concern that  the krogan are becoming a threat similar  to the rachni  the council begins creating a  contingency program a group of the  galaxy's best solarian special task  group operatives  anasari huntresses this military group  would be founded in 693  ce it would be called the special  tactics and reconnaissance branch of the  citadel or  spectres in 700 ce the krogan finally  reach and begin taking over lucia  an asari colony the council steps in  saying that the krogan have overstepped  the good faith they  earned when driving at the rachni the  krogan ambassador at the time  overlord kardak just walks out of the  council chambers daring the council to  try and stop the krogan  the council responds by sending in the  specters kicking off another war  called the krogan rebellions though the  specters proved to be devastatingly  effective allowed to use any act of war  they deem necessary  the council runs into the same problem  they did with the rachni the krogan  breed  too quickly for the hundreds killed  thousands take their place  each year in desperation the council  turns to another species the turians  unlike the more democratic species of  the milky way the turians had developed  into a hierarchy  one heavily defined by military service  the turians entered the krogan  rebellions and proved to be a  substantial threat  prompting the krogan to respond by  bombing turian colonies with weapons of  mass destruction this infuriates the  turians who decide the krogan must be  dealt with  permanently 10 years later however the  